Package: ergm.exclusive
Type: Package
Title: Exponential Random Graph Models for Exclusive Multi-Affiliation Networks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Exponential random graph models for networks in which every actor holds exactly one affiliation of each of
    several types (for example one agency and one club), with the size of every affiliation fixed. The package provides
    the typed-swap Metropolis-Hastings sampler on this sample space, statistics that link the affiliation types through
    the actors, exact enumeration of small networks, and benchmarks that check the sampler against the exact
    distribution. Development version; see the companion paper for the model.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: ergm
Imports: stats, network
LinkingTo: ergm
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
